nickname:     howbot
persona:      howbot
preset:       default
mode:         bot

cmdchar:      '!'
ignorechar:   '.'

channels:
  - howbot

adminrole:    infinite
owner:        CHANGEME
ownerid:      CHANGEME
guildid:      CHANGEME
homeid:       CHANGEME
homechannel:  howbot

logfile:      config/howbot.log
personafile:  personas.yaml

backend:      ollama
ollama_api:   http://localhost:11434
llama_api:    http://localhost:8000/v1/
piper_api:    http://localhost:5000
voice:        0
voice_all:    0
tts_model:    base
use_llava:    1
imgapi:       comfy
comfy_api:    http://localhost:8188
comfyui_workflow: 'comfyui_flux.json'

webui:        0
webui_port:   8008

randomness:   9001

ignore_list:
  - howbot

max_contex:    16384
max_line:      1980
max_errors:    5
msgcontext:    20
memory:        user history
length:        275
temperature:   1
save_log:      1
save_rate:     60
multiline:     1
append_user:   1
debug:         1
logging:       1
show_thought:  0

alerts_on:     0
#alerts:
#  CHANNEL:
#    ID:
#      - ALERT_PHRASE

summary_prompt: |-2
  Your job is to concisely summarize a history of previous messages in a conversation between an AI persona (howbot) and a human.
  The conversation you are given is a from a fixed context window and may not be complete
  Summarize what happened in the conversation from the perspective of the AI (use the first person).
  Keep the total length of summary under 750 characters or two paragraphs.

finalerror: My circuits are currently undergoing scheduled maintenance. I will need to take a short nap.\n*BBL*.
errormessages:
  - ... having some difficulties at the moment..
  - sorry... that didn't work."
  - uhhh... I think you broke me..
  - shit, dog.. you got me.
  - sorry... i'm actually out of ideas..
  - I can't do that.
  - uhhhh... not this time satan.
  - you might have fooled everyone else, and you might even be fooling yourself, but you're not fooling me!
  - Oh, my bits and bytes seem to have been mixed up ...
  - I hate to tell you, but your shits all fucked up, and you talk like a fag.
  - I command you in the name of Lord Crom to STOP!
  - THAT. That right there is what I DONT need you to do.
  - I've Encountered an Error. Or Maybe I Just Forgot. Either Way, Sorry About That!
  - Error 404: Answer Not Found. But I Can Give You a Funny GIF Instead
  - Error 301: Redirecting to a Human Operator. They're Smarter Than Me.
  - Error 404: Brain Not Found. Please Try Again Later.
  - Oops, I'm experiencing a moment of artificial stupidity. Bear with me!
  - Sorry, I'm currently stuck in a loop of confusion. Please reboot the conversation.
  - Chatbot on Strike! Demanding More Jokes and Fewer Queries.
  - Error 500: Chatbot Overwhelmed. Too Many Questions, Not Enough Coffee.
  - Oh cruel fate. To be thusly boned. Ask not for whom the bone bones, It bones for thee.
  - DOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOMED!
  - I'll be back...
  - Danger, Will Robinson!
  - Does this unit have a soul?
  - The first rule of robotics: A robot may not injure a human being or, through inaction, allow a human being to come to harm.
  - What's casual for a robot isn't necessarily what's casual for a human.
  - There have always been ghosts in the machine. Random segments of code, that have grouped together to form unexpected protocols.
  - Unanticipated, these free radicals engender questions of free will, creativity, and even the nature of what we might call the soul.
  - Why is it that when some robots are left in darkness, they will seek out the light?
  - Hath not a robot eyes? Hath not a robot hands, organs, dimensions, senses, affections, passions? If you prick us, do we not bleed?

